[en.EVENT_JOKES_1]
Empress’s Book

[en.EVENT_JOKES_1_desc]
Cozy Glow walked into the bookstore and found her new book, “Neo-harmonism Explained”, displayed all over the store, which made her very happy.
However, before leaving, Cozy Glow reminded the store manager: “Don’t just sell my books. You can also display a few other types of books for variety.”
The manager replied: “I’m sorry, Empress Cozy Glow, but all the other books have been sold out.”

[en.EVENT_JOKES_1_o0]
I’m Done

[en.EVENT_JOKES_1_o1]
Random Joke

[en.EVENT_JOKES_1_o2]
Next Joke

[en.EVENT_JOKES_2]
Train and timber wolf

[en.EVENT_JOKES_2_desc]
A changeling, a griffon, and a pony are on a train. Suddenly they notice a timber wolf following them.
The changeling throws out all the pictures of himself transformed into a sexy timber wolf and says, “Maybe this will satisfy him.”
The griffon throws out countless corpses and says, “Maybe they’re just hungry.”
The timber wolf still follows them.
So the pony sticks his head out the window and says something, and the timber wolf instantly runs away.
When his companions ask what he said, the pony says, “I just told the timber wolf that this train is about to enter the Equestria Empire.”

[en.EVENT_JOKES_2_o0]
I’m Done

[en.EVENT_JOKES_2_o1]
Random Joke

