[en.EVENT_JOKES_7]
Tartarus

[en.EVENT_JOKES_7_desc]
In the dungeon of Tartarus, three prisoners were discussing the reasons for their imprisonment.
The first pony said, “I was arrested for supporting Princess Luna.”
The second pony said, “I was arrested for opposing Princess Luna.”
The third pony said, “I am Princess Luna.”

