[en.EVENT_JOKES_9]
Empress’s Memoirs

[en.EVENT_JOKES_9_desc]
Cozy Glow heard that her memoirs were selling well in the Equestria Empire, so she instructed her subordinates at a meeting, “Remember to buy me a copy tomorrow. I also want to read it.”

[en.EVENT_JOKES_9_o0]
