[en.EVENT_JOKES_11]
Like My Wife

[en.EVENT_JOKES_11_desc]
The undercover police of the Empire’s Ministry of Order interviewed a random pony in Canterlot: "How do you view the Equestria Empire?"
“Oh, the Empire is like my wife.”
The undercover police didn’t quite understand and asked what that meant.
“First, I love her very much; second, I am very afraid of her; third, I want to change for another one.”

[en.EVENT_JOKES_11_o0]
