[en.EVENT_JOKES_19]
Empress’s Reputation

[en.EVENT_JOKES_19_desc]
Cozy Glow was worried that her reputation among the people was not very good, so she disguised herself as an ordinary pony and randomly asked the ponies passing by on the street.
She asked a pony, “What do you think of Empress Cozy Glow?” The pony was shocked after hearing this, quickly pulled Cozy into a nearby alley, looked around to make sure there were no eavesdroppers, and finally said:
“Let me tell you secretly, I support Empress Cozy Glow.”

[en.EVENT_JOKES_19_o0]
I’m Done

