[en.EVENT_JOKES_23]
Thank the Empress

[en.EVENT_JOKES_23_desc]
Two ponies were chatting. One of the ponies said, “I am very grateful to Empress Cozy Glow for giving me a happy childhood.”
The other pony asked, “Why? When you were young, Empress Cozy Glow hadn’t been born yet!”
The first pony replied, “That’s why I want to thank her!”

[en.EVENT_JOKES_23_o0]
I’m Done

