[en.EVENT_JOKES_25]
Friendship is Magic

[en.EVENT_JOKES_25_desc]
Twilight Sparkle once wrote in her diary: “Friendship is Magic!”
Maud Pie read it and asked, “What is magic?”
Tirek read it and asked, “What is friendship?”
Derpy Hooves read it and asked, “What is a diary?”
Cozy Glow read it and asked, “Why hasn’t the Ministry of Order banned this diary yet?”

