[en.EVENT_JOKES_27]
Star Wars

[en.EVENT_JOKES_27_desc]
Cozy Glow saw on the news that Las Pegasus had successfully test-fired the first rocket, and she was furious. She called in the astronauts in Canterlot and ordered them to board the sun today!
The astronaut said with tears: “Your majesty, we will be burned to death by the sun!”
Cozy Glow said: “Do you think I haven’t thought about it? The Empire has already arrested the princess responsible for controlling the sun!”

[en.EVENT_JOKES_27_o0]
I’m Done

