[en.EVENT_JOKES_29]
Building Materials

[en.EVENT_JOKES_29_desc]
I heard that houses in Canterlot are made of special materials, is that right?
Of course, all houses are made of ten percent cement and ninety percent listening devices!

[en.EVENT_JOKES_29_o0]
