[en.EVENT_JOKES_31]
Freedom of Speech

[en.EVENT_JOKES_31_desc]
Some ponies asked, the Equestria Empire and Free Equestria both guarantee freedom of speech, what is the difference between the two?
Answer: Free Equestria also guarantees your freedom after the speech.

