[en.EVENT_JOKES_36]
Sold Off

[en.EVENT_JOKES_36_desc]
Half of the military supplies allocated by the Empire to the EEMD were secretly sold off by Snips. When Cozy Glow found out, she was furious and sent the secret police to investigate whether Snails was involved.
The investigation revealed that Snails was indeed not involved in the matter at all. He sold off the other half.

